<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root { --primary: #1e40af; --primary-dark: #1e3a8a; --accent: #3b82f6; --text-main: #0f172a; --text-muted: #64748b; }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
        body { 
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f1f5f9 0%, #e2e8f0 100%); 
            min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; 
        }
        
        .login-wrapper {
            background: white; border-radius: 24px; box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
            display: flex; width: 1050px; max-width: 95%; min-height: 600px; overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .login-banner {
            flex: 1.2; 
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-dark));
            padding: 4.5rem; color: white; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .login-banner::before {
            content: ''; position: absolute; top: -50%; left: -50%; width: 200%; height: 200%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, transparent 60%);
            z-index: 1; pointer-events: none;
        }
        .login-banner-content { position: relative; z-index: 2; }
        
        .badge {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); backdrop-filter: blur(4px); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
            padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1px;
            display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        
        .login-banner h1 { font-size: 3.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -1px; }
        .login-banner p { color: #e2e8f0; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 300; }
        
        .login-form-area {
            flex: 1; padding: 4.5rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; background: white;
        }
        .header-form { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
        
        /* ILMU SIHIR CSS UNTUK LOGO TRANSPARAN */
        .logo-img { 
            height: 75px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; 
            mix-blend-mode: multiply; /* Menghilangkan background putih */
            filter: contrast(1.1); /* Mempertegas warna */
        }
        
        .header-form h2 { color: var(--text-main); font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
        .header-form p { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.95rem; }
        
        .input-group { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
        .input-group label { display: block; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: var(--text-main); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; }
        .input-box { position: relative; }
        .input-box i { position: absolute; left: 16px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); color: #94a3b8; font-size: 1.1rem; }
        .input-box input {
            width: 100%; padding: 15px 15px 15px 48px; border: 2px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 1rem; outline: none; transition: all 0.3s; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-main);
            background: #f8fafc;
        }
        .input-box input:focus { border-color: var(--accent); background: white; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15); }
        .input-box input::placeholder { color: #cbd5e1; font-weight: 400; }
        
        .btn-masuk {
            width: 100%; padding: 15px; background: var(--accent); color: white; border: none; border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; transition: 0.3s; margin-top: 1rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.4);
        }
        .btn-masuk:hover { background: #2563eb; transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.5); }
        
        .alert-error { 
            background: #fef2f2; color: #dc2626; padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 12px; 
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem; border: 1px solid #fecaca; display: flex; align-items: center; font-weight: 500;
        }
        
        /* Dekorasi Icon Latar Belakang */
        .bg-icon { position: absolute; bottom: -40px; right: -40px; font-size: 16rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); z-index: 1; transform: rotate(-15deg); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="login-wrapper">
        <div class="login-banner">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved bg-icon"></i>
            <div class="login-banner-content">
                <span class="badge">E-Government</span>
                <h1>Sistem Informasi Arsip Digital</h1>
                <p>Tingkatkan efisiensi dan transparansi pelayanan masyarakat dengan tata kelola digital. Akses persuratan, arsip, pelaporan, hingga regulasi kepenghuluan hanya dalam satu platform cerdas.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="login-form-area">
            <div class="header-form">
                <!-- Foto logo dibuat transparan otomatis oleh CSS -->
                <img src="/img/logo.png" class="logo-img" alt="Logo Desa" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
                <h2>Selamat Datang, Aparatur Kepenghuluan!</h2>
                <p>Silakan masuk menggunakan kredensial Anda</p>
            </div>
            
            <% if (typeof error !== 'undefined' && error) { %>
                <div class="alert-error"><i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation" style="margin-right: 10px; font-size: 1.2rem;"></i> <%= error %></div>
            <% } %>

            <form action="/login" method="POST">
                <div class="input-group">
                    <label>ID Pengguna atau Email</label>
                    <div class="input-box">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-user"></i>
                        <input type="text" name="username" placeholder="Masukkan ID Pengguna..." required autocomplete="off">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="input-group">
                    <label>Kata Sandi Keamanan</label>
                    <div class="input-box">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-lock"></i>
                        <input type="password" name="password" placeholder="••••••••" required>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <button type="submit" class="btn-masuk"><i class="fa-solid fa-right-to-bracket" style="margin-right: 8px;"></i> Buka Sistem</button>
            </form>
            
            <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 3rem; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 500;">
                &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> SIAD 2.0 &bull; Hak Cipta Dilindungi
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>